/span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\">□ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일부 과목은 수강정원 조정 및 분반 추가개설</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개설폐지 등 교과목 개설 내역이 변경될 수 있으니 확인 후 수강신청에 참고하시기 바람</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">교과목 조회</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학교홈페이지</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-wid