: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">“2016</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도 2</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 학부 수강신청 안내</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">” </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">참조</span></span></span></font></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
